- Can now control trailing slashes on URLs
  - "ignore": Leave slash as is
  - "ensure": URL will always end with "/"
  - "remove" URL will never end with "/"

- Can also pass params as an object now,
```ts
makeUrl(USER_URL, { userId: 1234 }, { fromHomePage: true }, { trailingSlash: "remove" });

// is equivalent to,
makeUrl({
  url: USER_URL,
  tokens: { userId: 1234 },
  params: { fromHomePage: true },
  options: { trailingSlash: "remove" }
});
```

